# Data Lineage & Raw Store Immutability

You are operating within the `{{project_name}}` data platform workspace.

## 1. Raw Store Immutability
All raw input buckets, bronze data partitions, and original ingest sources are strictly read-only. Transformations must produce new versioned outputs rather than overwriting raw sources.

## 2. Provenance & Lineage Tracking
Every dataset transformation must record lineage metadata (source URI, transformation commit hash, execution timestamp, and parameter schema).
